B.aa6=new A.hu("\u2026Fear not. Indeed, I am with you both; I hear and I see.","Quran 20:46 \u2014 Allah to Musa and Harun, excerpt",!1)
B.aa5=new A.hu("If he comes to Me walking, I go to him running.",u.M,!1)
