B.aoS=new A.jB("What Ar-Rayaan is","Ar-Rayaan is a study and reflection companion: Qur'an, hadith, supplications, prayer-time tools, learning material and stories. It is not a religious authority.")
B.ap2=new A.jB("Not a source of fatwa","Nothing in the app, including answers from Hadi, the Majlis or any calculator, is a fatwa or a ruling for your situation. For rulings on worship, family, finance, health or any personal matter, ask a qualified scholar. Calculated prayer times and Zakat amounts are aids; check them against your local mosque or scholar.")
B.ap3=new A.jB("Not medical, mental-health or emergency help","The app is not a medical or counselling service. If you or someone else is in danger, contact your local emergency number or a crisis line straight away. Sakina lists help lines by country, but the app cannot call for help on your behalf.")
B.ap1=new A.jB("Your account","You are responsible for what you do with your account and for keeping your password private. You can delete your account at any time from the Delete account screen.")
B.aoZ=new A.jB("The Majlis (community)","Posts in the Majlis are public and shown with the display name you choose. They are not reviewed before they appear. Do not post anything unlawful, abusive, hateful, deceptive, or that shares private information about other people, and do not claim to be Ar-Rayaan, its staff or a scholar. Posts can be reported and may be removed. You are responsible for what you post.")
B.aoW=new A.jB("Content and accuracy","We work to keep Qur'an, hadith and other religious content accurate and to cite sources, but errors can occur. If you find one, please tell us so it can be corrected.")
B.aoR=new A.jB("Changes and contact","These terms may change; the version shown here is the one that applies. Contact address: not published yet (pending before the public release).")
B.aK_=s([B.aoS,B.ap2,B.ap3,B.ap1,B.aoZ,B.aoW,B.aoR],t.J8)
